menu "GB Receiver"

    config GB_BLE_PASSKEY
        int "BLE pairing passkey"
        range 0 999999
        default 483265
        help
            Static passkey for pairing with a remote; gb_remote must use the
            same value. The default is public: set your own in sdkconfig for
            builds you ship. Bonded remotes keep working after a change, new
            pairings need the matching value.

endmenu
